## ReadImage

Read a local image and present it visually to the current multimodal model.

JSON schema:

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "file_path": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The absolute path of the PNG, JPEG, WebP, or GIF image to read."
    }
  },
  "required": ["file_path"],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

Usage:

- PNG, JPEG, WebP, and GIF are supported. Large supported images are validated and downscaled automatically.
